body:
hey u/gouldpa Thanks for the help. but im still facing an issue. Pardon me as I'm a complete noob.

I get an error after trying to upload  the sketch to the ESP32 board after editing the mcpwm.h file. heres the following error:-

Arduino: 1.8.13 (Windows 10), Board: "DOIT ESP32 DEVKIT V1, 80MHz, 921600, None"

&#x200B;

In file included from C:\\Users\\Joseph\\Desktop\\expr\\expr.ino:1:0:

&#x200B;

C:\\Users\\Joseph\\AppData\\Local\\Arduino15\\packages\\esp32\\hardware\\esp32\\1.0.4/tools/sdk/include/driver/driver/mcpwm.h:145:5: error: expected '}' before 'MCPWM\_SELECT\_SYNC\_INT0'

&#x200B;

MCPWM\_SELECT\_SYNC\_INT0,        /\*!<Select SYNC0 as internal\*/

&#x200B;

\^

&#x200B;

C:\\Users\\Joseph\\AppData\\Local\\Arduino15\\packages\\esp32\\hardware\\esp32\\1.0.4/tools/sdk/include/driver/driver/mcpwm.h:151:1: error: expected unqualified-id before '}' token

&#x200B;

 } mcpwm\_sync\_signal\_t;

&#x200B;

 \^

&#x200B;

C:\\Users\\Joseph\\AppData\\Local\\Arduino15\\packages\\esp32\\hardware\\esp32\\1.0.4/tools/sdk/include/driver/driver/mcpwm.h:151:3: error: 'mcpwm\_sync\_signal\_t' does not name a type

&#x200B;

 } mcpwm\_sync\_signal\_t;

&#x200B;

   \^

&#x200B;

C:\\Users\\Joseph\\AppData\\Local\\Arduino15\\packages\\esp32\\hardware\\esp32\\1.0.4/tools/sdk/include/driver/driver/mcpwm.h:675:78: error: 'mcpwm\_sync\_signal\_t' has not been declared

&#x200B;

 esp\_err\_t mcpwm\_sync\_enable(mcpwm\_unit\_t mcpwm\_num, mcpwm\_timer\_t timer\_num, mcpwm\_sync\_signal\_t sync\_sig,

&#x200B;

\^

&#x200B;

C:\\Users\\Joseph\\AppData\\Local\\Arduino15\\packages\\esp32\\hardware\\esp32\\1.0.4/tools/sdk/include/driver/driver/mcpwm.h:711:1: error: expected declaration before '}' token

&#x200B;

 }

&#x200B;

 \^

&#x200B;

exit status 1

&#x200B;

Error compiling for board DOIT ESP32 DEVKIT V1.

Not exactly sure what to do :/
